Description: RSRB @FLAVOR@ kernel @KVER@ for the Synology RS812
 Linux @KVER@ with the RS812 device tree, built to fit the 2 MiB kernel
 slot of the internal SPI flash. @FLAVORDESC@ Installs the modules and the uImage;
 the flash is only written when you run rsrb-flash-kernel.
